          "description": "Phase 2 模板主體擴充注入錨點（位於 P02_architecture_plan.md 尾部）"
        },
        {
          "value": "PHASE03_HEADER",
          "description": "Phase 3 模板標頭特化擴充注入錨點（位於 P03_api_spec.md）"
        },
        {
          "value": "PHASE03_AGENTS_GUILD",
          "description": "Phase 3 JIT 註解內部擴充注入錨點（位於 P03_api_spec.md 頂部）"
        },
        {
          "value": "PHASE03_TEMPLATE",
          "description": "Phase 3 模板主體擴充注入錨點（位於 P03_api_spec.md 尾部）"
